ape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 🚫 CLIPTextEncode（负向）\n- 约束模型远离常见缺陷；\n- 精准而克制：lowres/artifacts/watermark 等；\n- 负向过多可能与正向冲突。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [500, 150], "pos": [-793.5142211914062, 267.7532653808594], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 🖼️ EmptyLatentImage（768×768）\n- 决定输出尺寸与批量；\n- 768 是 SD2.1 的舒适区；\n- 批量>1 会显著占显存。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [500, 150], "pos": [-303.1690673828125, 557.1886596679688], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 🎚️ KSampler（核心采样）\n- **seed**：随机种子；固定=可复现；探索=随机化。\n- **control_after_generate**：fixed / randomize。\n- **steps**：采样步数；30 左右起步；越多越慢但细节↑。\n- **cfg**：提示词权重；6 左右稳妥；过高易假脸/过锐。\n- **sampler_name**：`dpmpp_2m_sde`（稳/细节好）或 `euler_a`（快）。\n- **scheduler**：`karras` 常用且稳定。\n- **denoise**：去噪强度；文生图 1.0；图生图/精修 0.3–0.6。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#354d73", "size": [540, 230], "pos": [266.5033264160156, -410.6927795410156], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [320, 360], "pos": [-1146.760009765625, 24.32792854309082], "widgets_values": ["cb0f4862608a5c8408d5745af676c851074dfae0399e597d8b69b7a1427c3c1d.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags":